ist + 3 albums was actually the *correct current state* at that moment, and the files huge.jpg/big.jpg were created by the app's \"Move to album\" (copy) at 11:42... no, Added 11:42 but the session started 11:42 and my move happened at ~11:47. Unless the device clock/status bar time wasn't updating? The status bar showed 11:42 at session start, 11:", "truncated": true}
