nt after favoriting*... no.\n\nLet me step back and consider that maybe the seeded bugs are:\n- Media chip: nav label (found).\n- Album grid header count: the \"1 items\" pluralization (rejected) OR the duplicate album after restore (rejected).\n- Favorites: the favorite loss after restore (rejected).\nMaybe the", "truncated": true}
