ite not. Element_ref: 16 (\"Favorite\" button). observed_quote: \"Favorite\".\n\nWait, but the developer rejected my previous similar report as \"could not reproduce\". Maybe they didn't have the specific state. This time the reproduction is clean and uses the original fixture. Let me file."}
